# Code owners — who is requested for review by default.
# https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repos-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# The project currently has a single maintainer; every path falls back to them.
# As the project grows, add area-specific owners above the catch-all (last match wins).

# Catch-all
*                       @rokbjc

# The normative standard (spec text, field registry, vocabulary, schemas, conformance vectors).
# Changes here can break every implementation — see docs/standard/versioning.md.
/docs/standard/         @rokbjc
/data/                  @rokbjc
/schemas/               @rokbjc
/conformance/           @rokbjc

# Reference implementation + build tooling.
/dotnet/                @rokbjc
/scripts/               @rokbjc

# Project meta / governance.
/.github/               @rokbjc
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @rokbjc
/GOVERNANCE.md          @rokbjc
